      "note": "The curated playbook override fires only on high-severity, multi-keyword matches of MFS / OTP / fake-authority playbooks. The held-out corpus (UCI SMS Spam, SpamAssassin, 1252 rows, mostly English) contains none of them, so it changes 0 decisions here: its value shows up on the Bangla / Hindi / Urdu MFS messages in the demo set and in the live app, not on this benchmark."
    },
